msgid "Behaviour on unknown key"
msgstr ""

msgid ":class:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a new empty :class:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary` and records "
"the access. Mirrors :class:`collections.defaultdict`."
msgstr ""

msgid ":class:`~ndict_tools.StrictNestedDictionary`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Raises :class:`KeyError`. Use when unknown keys should never go unnoticed"
" — configuration parsing, validated payloads."
msgstr ""

msgid ":class:`~ndict_tools.SmoothNestedDictionary`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a new empty :class:`~ndict_tools.SmoothNestedDictionary` at any "
"depth. Safe for deep chaining without prior key checks."
msgstr ""

